# Router kit HLA3-EntityType-filter: everything, with entity types rewritten in passing (value
# rules). An entity type that one side knows under another number is replaced wherever it occurs:
# an entity's EntityType and AlternateEntityType, the MunitionType of fire and detonations, and
# types inside records and arrays (articulated parts, silent entities). Exact matches only.
router.kind=iem
router.objects.allow=*
router.interactions.allow=*
# router.valuemap.<datatype>.<label> = A -> B [; C -> D]   (EntityType = EntityTypeStruct;
# kind.domain.country.category.subcategory.specific.extra). A becomes B in every direction.
# The same type under another country code:
router.valuemap.EntityType.air = 1.2.225.1.3.0.0 -> 1.2.222.1.3.0.0
# Two subcategories shown as one:
router.valuemap.EntityType.land = 1.1.225.1.1.3.0 -> 1.1.225.1.1.4.0; 1.1.225.1.1.5.0 -> 1.1.225.1.1.4.0
# other datatypes by their FOM name, e.g. the force of everything that passes:
# router.valuemap.ForceIdentifierEnum8.force = 1 -> 2
